                        name="CMS Compat Approach"
                        heading="Headless / API-First Delivery"
                        text="&lt;p&gt;Decouple your front-end from content and experience back-end. Power any modern framework &#8212; React, Next.js, Vue, mobile apps, or IoT &#8212; via ZensAI GraphQL and REST APIs.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;GraphQL &amp;amp; REST content delivery APIs&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;SDKs for React, Next.js, Vue, Angular&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Edge CDN with instant cache invalidation&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;AI-enriched API responses&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Preview API for any front-end framework&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;"/>
                    <item_1
                        jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                        sling:resourceType="core/franklin/components/block/v1/block/item"
