                        heading="Headful / Full-Stack Delivery"
                        text="&lt;p&gt;Use DXP AI built-in rendering engine to manage the full experience &#8212; from content authoring to page building to delivery &#8212; without a separate front-end application.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Drag-and-drop visual page builder&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Built-in multi-site &amp;amp; multi-language support&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Server-side rendering &amp;amp; static site generation&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Live preview &amp;amp; in-context editing&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;One-click deployment to global CDN&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;"/>
