                    name="Richtext"
                    overline="Platform Knowledge Base"
                    heading="What is a Digital Experience Platform?"
                    lead="A DXP is a platform that enables organizations to deliver personalized, consistent, and engaging digital experiences across all customer touchpoints."
                    text="&lt;p&gt;A &lt;strong&gt;Digital Experience Platform (DXP)&lt;/strong&gt; is a unified technology platform used by organizations to create, manage, deliver, and optimize digital experiences across multiple channels &#8212; such as websites, mobile apps, portals, chatbots, and email.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Think of it as the central hub that connects content, data, personalization, analytics, and integrations to deliver a consistent and engaging user experience at every touchpoint.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;What Does a DXP Do?&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Content Management&lt;/strong&gt; &#8212; Create and manage digital content with role-based authoring and approvals.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Personalized Experiences&lt;/strong&gt; &#8212; Deliver personalized content based on user behavior, profile, or context.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Multi-Channel Delivery&lt;/strong&gt; &#8212; Serve content across websites, mobile apps, portals, and headless APIs.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Integration Hub&lt;/strong&gt; &#8212; Connect with Salesforce CRM, SAP ERP, and marketing automation platforms.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytics &amp;amp; Insights&lt;/strong&gt; &#8212; Track user behavior, measure content performance, and optimize based on data.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-Powered Capabilities&lt;/strong&gt; &#8212; AI-driven search, content generation, intelligent recommendations, and conversational AI.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;"
                    sidebarTitle="See DXP AI in Action"
                    sidebarText="&lt;p&gt;Get a personalized walkthrough of ZensAI capabilities with one of our platform experts.&lt;/p&gt;"
                    ctaUrl="/content/my-dxp-site/contact"
                    ctaText="Request a Demo"/>
            </section_8>
